# Vulnerabilities accepted for deployment by scripts/predeploy-scan.sh.
# One ID per line. Every entry needs a reason and a review date, e.g.:
#
#   # libfoo heap overflow — only reachable via X, which we don't use.
#   # Review by 2026-12-31.
#   CVE-2026-12345
#
# Keep this list short; prefer rebuilding (--pull) or upgrading the lock.
